    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823840/extras/cbe8028214d04a72c862788aa55bd74f.poster.avif?t=1734465878\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823840/extras/cbe8028214d04a72c862788aa55bd74f.webm?t=1734465878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823840/extras/cbe8028214d04a72c862788aa55bd74f.mp4?t=1734465878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823840/extras/74a93eb9b392889945aea8383893aa6b.poster.avif?t=1734465878\" width=600 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823840/extras/74a93eb9b392889945aea8383893aa6b.webm?t=1734465878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823840/extras/74a93eb9b392889945aea8383893aa6b.mp4?t=1734465878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After a car crash sends you swerving off the highway into a junkyard, you'll need to find parts to repair your car while evading dangerous mechanical beings. As the story progresses, you'll encounter new creatures, locations, and challenges. Where will the night take you?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823840/extras/a7da8a4b778027da76d525ac60acdcdc.poster.avif?t=1734465878\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823840/extras/a7da8a4b778027da76d525ac60acdcdc.webm?t=1734465878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><